description:
IoTivity Communications Private Limited is a fast growing IoT company and is looking for a smart, energetic telecaller for handling inbound and outbound calls for it's customers.

**Job descriptions**:

* Make outbound calls to prospective customers;
* Introduce products and services;
* Qualify leads based on customer requirements;
* Schedule meetings and demonstrations;
* Maintain call records;
* Conduct follow-ups;
* Update CRM / database;
* Support the sales team in converting qualified leads;

**Key skills**:

* Excellent Communication in English, Hindi;
* Tele-calling;
* Lead Qualification;
* Customer Handling;
* Follow-up;
* Basic MS Office;
* CRM;

**Working days**:

* Monday - Friday: 9:30 AM - 6:30 PM
* Saturday: 9:30 AM - 2:30 PM

Pay: ₹15,000.00 - ₹18,000.00 per month

Work Location: In person
